Testing CSRF Tokens:
1. Remove the CSRF token and see if application accepts request (302 ok) 
2. Change the request method from POST to GET (and delete token)
3. Copy csrf from difeerent session and mix with your cookie

In order to exploit this vulnerability, we need to perform 2 things:
1. Inject a csrfKey cookie in the user's session (HTTP Header injection) - satisfied
2. Send a CSRF attack to the victim with a known csrf token

Jak przeprowadzamy atak:
test w intruder: 302 ok > KOD (regenerate + options> include auto submit) > kod wklejamy do exploit server

